WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
A task can narrow what you notice.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Some visible events go unreported.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Even experts can miss what they weren't searching for.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
But moving quickly can make an object easier to notice.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
None of these experiments proves an audio product changes the brain.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Start with the source. Then decide whether the audio format suits you.
